VERSION 2
RULE kmp.ios-trust-callback VERSION 1
IN FILE
WHEN TEXT_MATCHES "\\b(?:NSURLSessionAuthChallengeUseCredential|useCredential)\\b[^\\n]{0,200}\\b(?:NSURLCredential|credentialForTrust)\\b" ""
REPORT "KMP Native Apple Trust Challenge Accepts Credential"
SEVERITY MEDIUM
CONFIDENCE LOW
WITH TRACE
